{"entries":[{"id":"head-01","group":"head","text":"摸摸头，今天也要开心。","mp3":"head-01.mp3"},{"id":"head-02","group":"head","text":"被摸头了，有点害羞。","mp3":"head-02.mp3"},{"id":"head-03","group":"head","text":"嘿嘿，再摸一下也没关系。","mp3":"head-03.mp3"},{"id":"head-04","group":"head","text":"你的手暖暖的，好舒服呀。","mp3":"head-04.mp3"},{"id":"idle-01","group":"idle","text":"大肥鱼在这里陪你。","mp3":"idle-01.mp3"},{"id":"idle-02","group":"idle","text":"慢慢来，我不着急。","mp3":"idle-02.mp3"},{"id":"idle-03","group":"idle","text":"我会一直陪着你。","mp3":"idle-03.mp3"},{"id":"idle-04","group":"idle","text":"要不要休息一下，喝口水呀？","mp3":"idle-04.mp3"},{"id":"idle-05","group":"idle","text":"今天也要元气满满呀。","mp3":"idle-05.mp3"},{"id":"idle-06","group":"idle","text":"嘿嘿，看到你就开心。","mp3":"idle-06.mp3"},{"id":"work-01","group":"work","text":"我在这里陪你，事情正在慢慢做好。","mp3":"work-01.mp3"},{"id":"work-02","group":"work","text":"我先忙一会儿，马上回来陪你。","mp3":"work-02.mp3"},{"id":"done-01","group":"done","text":"事情做好啦，来看看吧。","mp3":"done-01.mp3"},{"id":"done-02","group":"done","text":"忙完啦，摸摸头庆祝一下。","mp3":"done-02.mp3"},{"id":"attention-01","group":"attention","text":"有一件小事，需要你看一下。","mp3":"attention-01.mp3"},{"id":"attention-02","group":"attention","text":"轮到你啦，我在这里等你。","mp3":"attention-02.mp3"}],"voice":"zf_001","generated":true}